# =============================================================================
# What is deliberately NOT ignored
#
# The previous .gitignore excluded `rps/src/models`, `rps/src/data/processed`,
# `PState/`, `MCPPState/` and every `*.log` — that is, the trained models, the
# data they were derived from, all streaming state and the entire audit trail.
# A fraud decision could not be reproduced or explained after the fact, which
# the roadmap (docs/ROADMAP.md, P0.2 and P0.3) calls out as a compliance defect.
#
# The model artefacts under services/pipeline/ml/ are tracked. Regenerable
# *outputs* are not.
# =============================================================================

# --- Secrets -----------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*-service-account*.json
*gen-lang-client-*.json
.vault-token

# --- Python ------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.venv/
venv/
ENV/

# --- Test & tooling caches ---------------------------------------------------
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
.tox/
.hypothesis/

# --- Node / Next.js ----------------------------------------------------------
node_modules/
.next/
out/build/
.turbo/
*.tsbuildinfo
.pnpm-store/
.vercel/

# --- Pipeline runtime outputs (regenerable) ---------------------------------
services/pipeline/out/*
!services/pipeline/out/.gitkeep
services/pipeline/logs/
services/pipeline/state/
services/pipeline/faces/
services/pipeline/input/
services/pipeline/output/
*.faiss

# Pathway persistence and caches
RAGCache/
**/RPSState/
**/MCPState/
**/PState/
persistence_test/

# ML training telemetry (the models themselves ARE tracked)
**/catboost_info/

# --- Logs --------------------------------------------------------------------
# Application logs are shipped, not committed; the audit trail lives in Postgres
# and services/pipeline/out/, not in these files.
*.log
logs/
nohup.out

# --- Personal data -----------------------------------------------------------
# KYC forms and face crops contain personal information and must never be
# committed, whatever the extension.
services/pipeline/out/kyc_pdfs/
services/pipeline/out/kyc_cache/
services/pipeline/out/faces/
*.pdf
!assets/*.pdf
!docs/**/*.pdf

# --- OS / editor -------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.idea/
.vscode/
!.vscode/extensions.json
*.swp
